" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>    <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>File</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">CLT_Daisy_Dress_A_Accessories</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Figaro_Pennygood\" title=\"Figaro Pennygood\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png/25px-Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png/38px-Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png/50px-Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Figaro 'Facemaker' Pennygood\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png/25px-Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Figaro_Pennygood\" title=\"Figaro Pennygood\">Figaro 'Facemaker' Pennygood</a> at the <a href=\"/wiki/Facemaker%27s_Boutique\" title=\"Facemaker's Boutique\">Facemaker's Boutique</a></li>\n<li>On the top floor of <a href=\"/wiki/Szarr_Palace\" title=\"Szarr Palace\">Szarr Palace</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-1241&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;982</span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>A <a href=\"/wiki/Mellow_Fruit_Dye\" title=\"Mellow Fruit Dye\">Mellow Fruit</a>-dyed version of this item is often worn by the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dream_Guardian\" title=\"Dream Guardian\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/96/Portrait_Dream_Guardian_1.png/25px-Portrait_Dream_Guardian_1.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/96/Portrait_Dream_Guardian_1.png/38px-Portrait_Dream_Guardian_1.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/96/Portrait_Dream_Guardian_1.png/50px-Portrait_Dream_Guardian_1.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dream Guardian\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/96/Portrait_Dream_Guardian_1.png/25px-Portrait_Dream_Guardian_1.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/96/Portrait_Dream_Guardian_1.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dream_Guardian\" title=\"Dream Guardian\">Dream Guardian</a> prior to being revealed as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Emperor\" title=\"The Emperor\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_The_Emperor.png/25px-Portrait_The_Emperor.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_The_Emperor.png/38px-Portrait_The_Emperor.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_The_Emperor.png/50px-Portrait_The_Emperor.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"The Emperor\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_The_Emperor.png/25px-Portrait_The_Emperor.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c6/Portrait_The_Emperor.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Emperor\" title=\"The Emperor\">The Emperor</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This item clips through the character on the backside, which can be especially noticeable on male characters while moving.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t<li class=\"gallerycaption\">Models</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 152.66666666667px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150.66666666667px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elegant_Robe_Human_Body1_Front_Model.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Body Type 1 Front Human\"><picture><img alt=\"Elegant Robe Human Front\" src=\"/w/images/c/c6/Elegant_Robe_Human_Body1_Front_Model.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"151\" height=\"400\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c6/Elegant_Robe_Human_Body1_Front_Model.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Body Type 1 Front <br><a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a></div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 151.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 149.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elegant_Robe_Human_Body1_Back_Model.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Body Type 1 Back Human\"><picture><img alt=\"Elegant Robe Human Back\" src=\"/w/images/0/07/Elegant_Robe_Human_Body1_Back_Model.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"400\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/07/Elegant_Robe_Human_Body1_Back_Model.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Body Type 1 Back <br><a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a></div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 159.3333